define('taoQtiTest/controller/creator/components/testComments',['jquery', 'lodash', 'i18n', 'taoItems/services/itemComments', 'taoItems/comments/itemCommentsStore', 'taoItems/comments/commentsPanel', 'css!taoQtiTestCss/test-comments'], function ($, _, __, itemCommentsApi, itemCommentsStoreFactory, commentsPanelFactory) {
  'use strict';

  var TAB_PROPERTIES = 'properties';
  var TAB_COMMENTS = 'comments';
  var NS = '.testComments';
  function init(options) {
    var testUri = options && options.testUri;
    var storeFactory = options && options.storeFactory || itemCommentsStoreFactory;
    var panelFactory = options && options.panelFactory || commentsPanelFactory;
    var mentionsEnabled = options && options.mentionsEnabled === true;
    if (!testUri) {
      return null;
    }
    var $root = options.$container ? $(options.$container) : $('#test-creator');
    var $propsSection = $root.find('.test-creator-props');
    var $modeTabs = $propsSection.find('#test-creator-mode-tabs');
    var $commentsTab = $modeTabs.find('[data-tab="comments"]');
    var $propertiesPanel = $propsSection.find('[data-mode-panel="properties"]');
    var $commentsPanel = $propsSection.find('[data-mode-panel="comments"]');
    var $commentsHost = $commentsPanel.find('.test-comments-content-panel');
    if (!$modeTabs.length || !$commentsHost.length) {
      return null;
    }
    var store = storeFactory({
      resourceUri: testUri,
      resourceType: itemCommentsApi.RESOURCE_TYPE.TEST
    });
    var panel = panelFactory({
      renderTo: $commentsHost,
      store: store,
      mentionsEnabled: mentionsEnabled
    });
    function updateCountLabel() {
      var label = $commentsTab.data('label') || __('Comments');
      $commentsTab.find('.tab-label').text(label);
      $commentsTab.attr('title', label).attr('aria-label', label);
    }
    function setMode(mode) {
      var isComments = mode === TAB_COMMENTS;
      $modeTabs.find('[role="tab"]').each(function () {
        var $tab = $(this);
        var active = $tab.data('tab') === mode;
        $tab.toggleClass('active', active).attr('aria-selected', active ? 'true' : 'false').attr('tabindex', active ? '0' : '-1');
      });
      $propertiesPanel.prop('hidden', isComments);
      $commentsPanel.prop('hidden', !isComments);
      $propsSection.children('.props').prop('hidden', isComments);
      if (isComments) {
        panel.refresh();
      }
    }
    function getTabs() {
      return $modeTabs.find('[role="tab"]');
    }
    function focusTabByIndex(index) {
      var $tabs = getTabs();
      var count = $tabs.length;
      if (!count) {
        return;
      }
      var normalizedIndex = (index + count) % count;
      $tabs.eq(normalizedIndex).trigger('focus');
    }
    store.on(["loaded".concat(NS), "countchange".concat(NS), "submitted".concat(NS), "updated".concat(NS), "resolved".concat(NS), "deleted".concat(NS)].join(' '), () => {
      updateCountLabel();
    });
    $modeTabs.on("click".concat(NS), '[role="tab"]', e => {
      e.preventDefault();
      var mode = $(e.currentTarget).data('tab') || TAB_PROPERTIES;
      setMode(mode);
    });
    $modeTabs.on("keydown".concat(NS), '[role="tab"]', e => {
      var $tab = $(e.currentTarget);
      var mode = $tab.data('tab') || TAB_PROPERTIES;
      var $tabs = getTabs();
      var tabIndex = $tabs.index($tab);
      switch (e.key) {
        case 'Enter':
        case ' ':
        case 'Spacebar':
          e.preventDefault();
          setMode(mode);
          $tab.trigger('focus');
          break;
        case 'ArrowRight':
          e.preventDefault();
          focusTabByIndex(tabIndex + 1);
          break;
        case 'ArrowLeft':
          e.preventDefault();
          focusTabByIndex(tabIndex - 1);
          break;
        case 'Home':
          e.preventDefault();
          focusTabByIndex(0);
          break;
        case 'End':
          e.preventDefault();
          focusTabByIndex($tabs.length - 1);
          break;
        default:
          break;
      }
    });
    $propsSection.on("propopen.propview".concat(NS), () => {
      setMode(TAB_PROPERTIES);
    });
    updateCountLabel();
    setMode(TAB_PROPERTIES);
    store.load().catch(_.noop);
    return {
      store: store,
      panel: panel,
      setMode: setMode,
      destroy() {
        $modeTabs.off(NS);
        $propsSection.off(NS);
        store.off(NS);
        panel.destroy();
      }
    };
  }
  return {
    init: init
  };
});
